<section class="honest">
  <div class="wrap honest__inner">
    <h2>Honest: it's beta.</h2>

    <p class="honest__body">
      Express and Fastify have a decade of ecosystem. Green Tea doesn't — yet. You come for the model and the
      ergonomics. If you're tired of maintaining someone else's foundation, come try it.
    </p>

    <div class="btn-row honest__ctas">
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="https://docs.green-tea.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Read the docs
      </a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="https://github.com/green-tea-dev/green-tea" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Star on GitHub
      </a>
    </div>

    <p class="honest__signoff">That's the tea. 🍵</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .honest__inner {
    max-width: 60ch;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .honest__body {
    color: var(--dim);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin: 0 auto 2rem;
    max-width: 52ch;
  }

  .honest__ctas {
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .honest__signoff {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--matcha);
  }
</style>
